---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="급여량 참고 계산기 — emfls pet" description="사료 포장지의 표시 급여량을 기준으로 하루 총량과 1회 참고 급여량을 계산합니다."><div class="tool-head"><a href="/tools/">← 반려생활 도구</a><span class="eyebrow">FEEDING REFERENCE</span><h1>표시 급여량을<br /><em>쉽게 나눠보세요.</em></h1><p>제품 포장지의 권장량을 바탕으로 한 단순 참고 계산기예요.</p></div><section class="calculator" aria-labelledby="feeding-title"><h2 id="feeding-title">급여량 입력</h2><form id="feeding-form"><label>제품 표시 기준 체중 (kg)<input name="labelWeight" type="number" min="0.1" step="0.1" inputmode="decimal" required /></label><label>제품 표시 하루 권장량 (g)<input name="labelAmount" type="number" min="0.1" step="0.1" inputmode="decimal" required /></label><label>반려동물 실제 체중 (kg)<input name="petWeight" type="number" min="0.1" step="0.1" inputmode="decimal" required /></label><label>하루 급여 횟수<input name="meals" type="number" min="1" step="1" inputmode="numeric" required /></label><p id="feeding-error" class="error" role="alert"></p><div class="form-actions"><button class="calculate" type="submit">참고량 계산하기 →</button><button id="feeding-reset" type="button">초기화</button></div></form><div id="feeding-result" class="result" hidden aria-live="polite"><span class="eyebrow">REFERENCE RESULT</span><div class="result-grid"><div><small>하루 참고 급여량</small><strong id="daily-result"></strong></div><div><small>1회 참고 급여량</small><strong id="meal-result"></strong></div></div><p>이 결과는 <strong>단순 참고 계산</strong>입니다. 제품 제조사의 권장 급여표를 우선으로 확인하세요.</p></div><aside class="caution"><strong>꼭 확인해 주세요</strong><p>나이, 활동량, 중성화 여부, 건강 상태에 따라 실제 필요량은 달라질 수 있습니다. 건강 문제가 있거나 체중 조절이 필요한 경우 수의사와 상담하세요.</p></aside></section></Layout>
<script>
const form=document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#feeding-form')!; const error=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#feeding-error')!; const result=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#feeding-result')!; const reset=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#feeding-reset')!; const dailyResult=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#daily-result')!; const mealResult=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#meal-result')!; const round=(value:number)=>Math.round(value*10)/10; form.addEventListener('submit',(event)=>{event.preventDefault(); const data=new FormData(form); const labelWeight=Number(data.get('labelWeight')); const labelAmount=Number(data.get('labelAmount')); const petWeight=Number(data.get('petWeight')); const meals=Number(data.get('meals')); if(![labelWeight,labelAmount,petWeight,meals].every(Number.isFinite)||labelWeight<=0||labelAmount<=0||petWeight<=0||meals<=0||!Number.isInteger(meals)){error.textContent='모든 항목에 0보다 큰 숫자를 입력하고, 급여 횟수는 정수로 입력해 주세요.'; result.hidden=true; return;} const daily=labelAmount*(petWeight/labelWeight); dailyResult.textContent=`${round(daily)} g`; mealResult.textContent=`${round(daily/meals)} g`; error.textContent=''; result.hidden=false;}); reset.addEventListener('click',()=>{form.reset(); error.textContent=''; result.hidden=true; form.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('input')?.focus();});
</script>
<style>.tool-head{padding:44px 0 34px}.tool-head>a{font-size:13px;color:#4a756d;font-weight:700}.tool-head .eyebrow{display:block;margin-top:40px}.tool-head h1{font-size:42px;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.08em;margin:15px 0 10px}.tool-head em{font-style:normal;color:#328a7c}.tool-head p{color:#6d7d77}.calculator{max-width:720px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e4ebe5;border-radius:24px;padding:25px}.calculator h2{font-size:21px;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:0 0 22px}.calculator form{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}.calculator label{display:grid;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:#65756f;font-weight:700}.calculator input{height:46px;border:1px solid #dce5df;border-radius:10px;padding:0 12px;background:#fbfcfa;font:inherit;color:#243331;outline:none}.calculator input:focus{border-color:#287c70;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #287c7024}.error{grid-column:1/-1;color:#bf513f;font-size:12px;margin:0}.form-actions{grid-column:1/-1;display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}.calculate{border:0;border-radius:11px;background:#287c70;color:#fff;padding:13px 17px;font:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.form-actions button:last-child{border:0;background:transparent;color:#e67358;font:inherit;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.result{margin-top:26px;padding:20px;background:#eaf3ee;border-radius:18px}.result-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin:15px 0}.result-grid div{background:#fff;border-radius:13px;padding:14px}.result-grid small{display:block;color:#74817d;font-size:11px}.result-grid strong{display:block;color:#287c70;font-size:25px;margin-top:7px}.result>p,.caution p{font-size:12px;color:#62736c;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.result>p strong{color:#287c70}.caution{margin-top:15px;padding:16px;background:#fff6e9;border-radius:14px;color:#8c662e}.caution strong{font-size:12px}.caution p{margin-top:6px;color:#806f50}@media(max-width:640px){.tool-head{padding:35px 0 25px}.tool-head h1{font-size:33px}.calculator{padding:18px;border-radius:20px}.calculator form{grid-template-columns:1fr}.result-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.error,.form-actions{grid-column:auto}}</style>
